The following books shall be kept in both registries—
  (a) register of documents of which the registration is compulsory;
  (b) register of documents of which the registration is optional;
  (c) register of reasons for refusal to register;
  (d) register of reasons for cancellation of the registration of a document. (Act No. 24 of 1950, s. 3, Act No. 41 of 1956, s. 5)
